  "notes": "Image 1 shows the XIAO nRF52840 (Model: XIAO-nRF52840 printed on the shield); image 2 shows the Wio-SX1262 board of the kit. Both are transcribed. In image 1 the nRF port names (P0.02, P1.15 ...) are the printed GPIO names and are used as labels per rule 5, with the board names (D0, A0, SDA ...) in functions read outward from the pin. Square pads in image 2 are not treated as pin-1 marks (rule 9)."
